## Standing boundary

The generator, subprocess simulation, filesystem bundle, BLAKE3 receipt, tamper refusal, and replay may achieve bounded `ALIVE` standing after execution. Historical reconstruction, real contracts, real credentials, real organizational capability, and real external actuation remain `UNKNOWN` until independently admitted evidence exists.
